WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.110
Use your power to bring smiles 
to the world and the future.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:16.310
Ute, the guy from the Xyz Dimension who 
looks like me, said that and vanished.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.760
But my opponent in the second match 
of the Maiami Championship...

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:27.840
...is a fierce martial artist whose 
dueling doesn't make people smile.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:31.700
Isao Kachidoki.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.720
I don't accept his method of dueling.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.240
I'll duel the way I believe 
in and make him smile!

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:46.890
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:52.090
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:55.100
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:59.370
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:02.120
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:04.790
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:07.590
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:18.710
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:24.180
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:29.780
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:33.920
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.860
Repeating Up/Down

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.190
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:47.470
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:50.900
Because I don't want to give up

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:55.910
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:02.980
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:13.490
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:16.200
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.900
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.690
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:24.440
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:34.000
Awaken to Wrath

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:46.020
The man Gongenzaka won't 
be deceived by this trick!

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:52.140
Susanowo attacks you directly!

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:56.250
How did you know?

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.580
Nothing I couldn't handle.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:04.500
He solved his tricky duel of camouflage!

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.760
In the first match of the second round,

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:12.740
Gongenzaka Dojo's Noboru Gongenzaka has 
defeated Surprise School's Yuzo Tanegashima!

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:14.000
He did it.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:16.260
Yuya is up next.

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.060
Yeah.

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:20.130
Next is the second match!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:22.200
Here come the competitors!

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:25.400
You Show School's Yuya Sakaki!

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.900
Go, Yuya!

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:28.140
I was waiting for you!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.590
Thank you!

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:37.960
Hey, don't be nervous.  You're 
not the ones competing.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:41.960
Because today's opponent is Isao Kachidoki.

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:44.260
Didn't you see Kachidoki's match yesterday?

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.440
It was so intense that it gave me shivers.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:52.960
LDS Synchro Course's ace Yaiba 
Toudou was totally pummeled.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:57.600
And Kachidoki finished second 
in this tournament last year.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.720
Last year's winner was 
promoted to Youth Division.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:06.660
Kachidoki is the #1 favorite 
to win this year's tournament.

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:10.630
Facing him is Ryozanpaku 
School's Isao Kachidoki!

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.710
He's scary even before the duel begins!

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:31.020
No smiling during duels.

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:34.450
That is Ryozanpaku's fighting style.

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.030
Fighting style...

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.400
For them, winning is everything.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:45.760
As you've seen, they'll do anything 
to win, including dueling savagely.

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:48.940
Ryozanpaku School's 
headmaster Ryozan Godagawa

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:52.440
has been criticized for 
his savage duel style.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:05:00.280
But he's brushed off criticism 
by winning numerous pro titles.

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:02.700
He seems strict.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:06.260
Yes.  And they're all boarding students.

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:09.890
Other than attending school, 
they're not allowed to go outside.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:14.160
They're not even allowed to see their 
parents until they become pros.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.000
I'd shiver so much that I'd run away!

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.770
But no matter how strict it gets,

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:23.140
a neverending flow of students 
apply to Ryozanpaku School.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:27.630
Because they're second only 
behind LDS in creating pros.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:34.330
And the clear standout at Ryozanpaku 
School is Isao Kachidoki.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:41.900
The two are squaring off, so it's 
time to choose the Field Spell!

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:47.620
Action Field on!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:51.940
The Field Spell Bamboo 
Battleground activates!

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:11.520
I saw your duel yesterday.

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.620
I don't accept your method of dueling.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.190
That was no duel.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:27.130
The duelists meet at the battlefield.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:33.100
Along with their monsters, they'll kick the ground 
and fly through the sky to move around the field!

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:36.840
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:38.710
Action!

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:39.800
Duel!

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.620
It's my turn!

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:53.230
I summon Performapal 
Silver Claw from my hand!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.840
Nice, Yuya!

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:02.330
You're cool!

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.640
Yuya!

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:06.510
Look ahead!

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.680
He's eating bamboo leaves.  Is he a panda?

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:24.890
No matter who the opponent, 
Yuya is still the same.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:27.090
Still the same...

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:33.870
I know he's disturbed after 
meeting Ute that night

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:38.300
and hearing about the 
crazy dimensional battles.

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:45.930
But Yuya is still facing 
his challenges head-on.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:48.440
I end my turn!

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:50.750
I draw.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.710
When monsters are only on your field,

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:59.960
I can summon Hayate the Earth Star 
from my hand without tribute.

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:09.540
There it is!  Kachidoki already 
summoned a high-class monster!

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:14.740
Let's battle!  Hayate attacks Silver Claw!

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.450
I found one!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.360
That was close...

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:41.770
You're too slow.  The battle continues.

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:52.440
Kachidoki has already dealt damage!

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:56.650
A destroyed Pendulum Monster 
goes to the Extra Deck.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.880
I end my turn.

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.220
That's not fair!

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:02.400
Yuya would've had it if he didn't interfere!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.360
It's so dirty that it gives me shivers.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:13.800
So you're going to keep dueling like that.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:18.320
In that case, I'll duel the way I believe in!

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:19.970
My turn!

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:21.440
It's here!

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:29.240
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 4 
Performapal Trump Witch and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:44.000
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 5 and 7 simultaneously!

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.970
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:49.940
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.540
Pendulum Summon!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:55.870
Appear, the heroic one with 
beautiful different-colored eyes!

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:58.420
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:01.780
Sakaki has Pendulum Summoned!

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:03.980
The fun is only getting started!

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:07.320
Yuya!

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:08.690
Go!

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:10.590
Fun?

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:13.890
Yeah!  You need to have fun in a duel.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:16.600
I'm only here to win.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:21.330
I want to win too, but there's 
more to dueling than that!

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:27.880
I summon Performapal Camelump from my hand!

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:33.850
Let's battle!

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:38.180
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
attacks Hayate the Earth Star!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:43.230
Hayate's effect activates.

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:49.400
When there are no other monsters on my 
field, I can negate your attack one time.

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:54.030
Kachidoki with an excellent reversal!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:58.300
I never thought it would 
end the duel.  Right?

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:02.300
This situation...

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:05.420
Trump Witch is in the Pendulum Zone.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:08.210
It's the same as his match against Sawatari.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:12.450
I activate Performapal Trump 
Witch's Pendulum Effect!

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:17.800
Once per turn, I can Fusion Summon 
using the monsters on my field!

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:24.760
I use Performapal Camelump 
and Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:25.730
Here it comes!

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:29.440
The beast returning alive 
from the scorching lands,

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:33.440
become one with the mysterious dragon 
to give birth to a new power!

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.660
Fusion Summon!

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:40.080
Come out, the ferocious dragon 
with glowing beastly eyes!

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:44.130
Level 8 Beast-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:48.140
He did it!  Pendulum Fusion!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:51.260
It's Sakaki's new ace monster!

00:11:51.260 --> 00:11:56.060
The two Pendulum Monsters that were 
fused together go to the Extra Deck.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.220
Here I go, Dad!

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:14.180
Okay!  Bring it on!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.680
Surprise your dad!

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:22.440
Here I go!  It's entertainment!

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.640
Do not think that dueling is fun.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:29.930
Your path will not be childish.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:35.900
Your parents bought you that Duel Disk, but 
you won't see them again until you become a pro.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:42.200
Until then, you will walk 
the path of shadows.

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:44.640
I did it!

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:52.380
Since that day, it was destined 
that we would duel each other.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.350
What are you talking about?

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:56.060
Bring it on!

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.320
Let's battle!

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:04.100
Beast-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
attacks Hayate the Earth Star!

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:09.780
I activate the Action Spell Evasion.

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:13.060
It negates your monster's attack.

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:17.320
Kachidoki avoided another attack!

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:21.860
Well?  Are you done having your fun duel?

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:22.780
What?

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.740
If you're done, then end your turn.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.220
I'm up next!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.330
Hurry up and end your turn.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.740
I'll have you entertain me.

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:43.300
I end my turn.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:44.920
I draw!

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:48.270
When there's an Earth Attribute 
monster on my field,

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.910
I can summon Tenma the 
Sky Star without tribute!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:59.990
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization on Tenma and Hayate.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:00.720
What?

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:04.380
The star in the heavens, fly over the earth.

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:12.360
Become one and shine as the 
eternal conquering star!

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:16.900
Fusion Summon!

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:20.840
Come, Idaten the Conqueror Star!

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:26.800
Whoa!  Kachidoki also Fusion Summoned!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:31.580
He couldn't win it all last 
year, so he's improved!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:35.550
Its attack points are equal to 
Beast-Eyes, but knowing Yuya...

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:37.820
I need an Action Card.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:41.620
I'll tell you what Idaten's effect is.

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:45.500
When this card battles against a 
monster with equal or lower Level,

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.370
your monster's attack points become 0.

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:49.130
What?

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:54.440
If Beast-Eyes's attack points become 0, he'll 
take 3000 points of damage in a single strike!

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:08.120
I equip Idaten with the Equip 
Spell Magic Star Sword!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:12.920
By discarding a spell card that 
I add to my hand this turn,

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:15.160
it gains 100 attack points!

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:24.720
Ouch...

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:28.910
I send one Action Card to the graveyard.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:32.380
Idaten gains 100 attack points.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.710
Action Spells count as spell cards.

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:38.850
So the more he discards, the 
more attack points it gains!

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:55.030
I send a second Action Card to the graveyard.

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:58.500
Third to the graveyard!

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:01.460
Fourth to the graveyard!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.400
Fifth to the graveyard!

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:07.520
Sixth to the graveyard!

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:10.930
He's playing so dirty.

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:14.100
Yuya currently has 3700 life points.

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:16.590
At this rate, he'll lose!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:22.160
If he gets another Action Card, 
my life points will be gone!

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:25.920
I won't let you get an Action Card!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:26.770
What?

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:32.910
So far, you've been walking on a 
sunny path without a single shadow.

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:34.210
What are you talking about?

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:37.880
I've been walking on a path of darkness.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:40.050
I won't lose to the likes of you!

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:42.250
I will definitely win!

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:44.100
You don't know that!

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:47.750
I'm going to get it!

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:48.750
I won't let you!  Battle!

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:52.520
Idaten attacks Beast-Eyes!

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:57.000
Idaten's effect activates!

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:59.980
Beast-Eyes's attack points become 0!

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:05.170
The winds of victory blows for the 
one who has seen true darkness!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:11.530
I won't give up!

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:16.550
Hey.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:18.040
What happened?

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.250
Yuya.

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:21.720
Yuya...

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:33.580
Sakaki stopped him from 
getting the Action Card,

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:36.370
but he took big damage and 
only has 100 life points left!

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:39.840
I end my turn.

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:48.820
You managed to survive, 
but darkness approaches.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:56.120
You will fall into the darkness.

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.530
My turn.  I draw.

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:35.130
I activate the Action Spell Mad Hurricane.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:39.820
It returns all the cards 
on my field to my deck.

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:42.800
There are no cards on Sakaki's field!

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:46.040
Yuya, what are you planning to do?

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:53.220
I set the Pendulum Scale with Performapal 
Turn Toad and Performapal Cheermole.

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:02.690
Now I can summon Level 4 
monsters simultaneously.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.660
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:08.420
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:10.630
Pendulum Summon!

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:14.000
Come out, my monsters!

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:17.340
From my Extra Deck, Performapal Camelump!

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:19.570
Performapal Silver Claw!

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.040
What's he going to do?

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:25.280
With Level 4 Performapal Camelump

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:29.950
and Performapal Silver Claw, 
I build the Overlay Network!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.850
From the black darkness,

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:39.570
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:41.460
Xyz Summon!

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:46.560
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:52.870
He Xyz Summoned after Pendulum Summoning?

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.110
What?

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:56.840
Yuya summoned Ute's dragon?

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:59.810
Why does he have Dark Rebellion?

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:03.160
So he does possess it.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:08.380
I activate Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon's effect!

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:12.200
By using one Overlay Unit, 
until the end of this turn...

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:17.870
...your Level 5-or-above monster's 
attack points are halved,

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:21.200
and my monster gains that amount.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:23.980
Treason Discharge!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:27.170
I also use the remaining Overlay Unit.

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:29.640
Dark Rebellion's effect activates.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.640
Treason Discharge!

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:38.050
5200 attack points!

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:39.520
Let's battle.

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:45.620
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon attacks 
Idaten the Conqueror Star.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:49.280
Idaten's effect activates!

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:52.400
When it battles a monster 
with equal or lower Level,

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:54.980
your monster's attack points become 0!

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:59.540
Xyz Monsters don't have Levels, 
so your effect is negated.

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:03.240
What?  Having no Level 
isn't the same as Level 0?

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:07.010
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:23.330
The winner is Yuya Sakaki.

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:27.030
Nice, Yuya.

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:29.280
He's so scary that I'm shivering.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:30.500
Yuya.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:32.000
He's like a different person.

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:40.410
Kachidoki!

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:42.550
Are you okay?

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:08.580
What am I feeling?

00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:35.880
As long as there's a smile

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:42.660
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:47.960
I always believe

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:51.480
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.830 --> 00:22:57.110
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:05.750
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:12.620
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:19.290
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:23.360
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:49.910 --> 00:23:52.330
I won in a duel against Kachidoki.

00:23:52.330 --> 00:23:59.300
I'm full of regret because I won in a 
horrible way that couldn't make Kachidoki smile.

00:24:00.020 --> 00:24:03.700
That's when Reiji Akaba meets a certain girl.

00:24:04.060 --> 00:24:08.360
That meeting will bring unrest.

00:24:09.030 --> 00:24:13.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Academia's Warrior

00:24:13.870 --> 00:24:16.060
The fun is only getting started!
